## Run the Project

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Oyoo-Frankline/Sales-Demand-Forecasting-Model.git
cd Sales-Demand-Forecasting-Model
```

Install the required libraries:

```bash
pip install pandas numpy matplotlib scikit-learn jupyter
```

Open Jupyter Notebook:

```bash
jupyter notebook
```

Then open **`Sales Project.ipynb`** and run the notebook from beginning to end.

## Notebook

The complete notebook contains the data preparation, analysis, visualizations, forecasting models, evaluation, and business insights.
